  "Six {{r|...}} uses in the infobox (before the window start 1627) are not listed. The window ends at 9627 inside the StateAstronomicalInstitute list-defined ref (starts before the window, so in scope); the six refs after it (Fontanka.ru, CentralBureauForAstronomicalTelegrams, Gazeta.Ru, NASA, RIANovosti, Chandler2025) start after the window and are listed with in_window=false because in-window uses bind to them. The only DOI (Chandler2025 doi=10.3847/2515-5172/ada368) starts after the window and is not listed. {{citation needed}} is not a footnote. Infobox observatory child module and {{Authority control}} may render extra content; not in source refs."
